## Third-party components

No third-party components are bundled in this repository. The shipped
`codetopo-0.5.0.mcpb` bundle contains only this project's own manifest and
launcher (`server/launcher.js`); at runtime the launcher downloads the pinned
`codetopo-mcp` build — the codetopo engine, published under the same licence
from the nrupala/codetopo repository — and verifies its SHA-256 against
`server/pins.json` before running it.
